    <briefdescription>
<para>Log sequence position identifying one byte-offset in WAL history. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Write-Ahead Log (WAL) Manager</para>
<para>Manages write-ahead logs for replica synchronization. Inspired by PostgreSQL&apos;s WAL architecture.</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Sequential log writing</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Log segment rotation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Position tracking (<ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_l_s_n" kindref="compound">LSN</ref> - Log Sequence Number)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Atomic log entries</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Crash recovery support </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
